<p dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"68:1-68:128"><strong data-sourcepos=3D"68=
:1-68:14">CodeCommit</strong> is a secure, highly scalable, managed source =
control service that hosts private Git repositories.=E2=80=8B It provides:<=
/p>
<ul dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"69:1-72:0">
<li data-sourcepos=3D"69:1-69:40">Integration with other AWS services=E2=80=
=8B</li>
<li data-sourcepos=3D"70:1-70:41">Pull requests and approval templates=E2=
=80=8B</li>
<li data-sourcepos=3D"71:1-72:0">Access control=E2=80=8B</li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"73:1-73:86"><strong data-sourcepos=3D"73:=
1-73:13">CodeBuild</strong> is a fully managed build service in the cloud. =
=E2=80=8BIt's features include:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"74:1-77:0">
<li data-sourcepos=3D"74:1-74:113">Fully managed =E2=80=93 CodeBuild elimin=
ates the need to set up, patch, update, and manage your own build servers.=
=E2=80=8B</li>
<li data-sourcepos=3D"75:1-75:129">On demand =E2=80=93 CodeBuild scales on =
demand to meet your build needs. You pay only for the number of build minut=
es you consume.=E2=80=8B</li>
<li data-sourcepos=3D"76:1-77:0">Out of the box =E2=80=93 CodeBuild provide=
s preconfigured build environments for the most popular programming languag=
es. All you need to do is point to your build script to start your first bu=
ild.=E2=80=8B</li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"78:1-78:197"><strong data-sourcepos=3D"78=
:1-78:14">CodeDeploy</strong> is a deployment service that automates applic=
ation deployments to Amazon EC2 instances, on-premises instances, serverles=
s Lambda functions, or Amazon ECS services. You can deploy:=E2=80=8B</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"79:1-87:0">
<li data-sourcepos=3D"79:1-79:9">Code=E2=80=8B</li>
<li data-sourcepos=3D"80:1-80:36">Serverless AWS Lambda functions=E2=80=8B<=
/li>
<li data-sourcepos=3D"81:1-81:32">Web and configuration files=E2=80=8B</li>
